### Configuración de Variables Básicas
@hostname = localhost
@port = 80
@baseUrl = http://{{hostname}}:{{port}}/api/v1

### 1. Health Check (Verificar Estado)
# @name health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Login (Iniciar Sesión y guardar Token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "admin@garrafaya.bo",
  "password": "GarrafaYa2026!"
}

### Guardamos el token de la respuesta en una variable dinámica
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### 3. Consultar Perfil (Verificar Token Automático)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 4. Módulo de Clientes (Prueba de Base de Datos)
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}




### 5. Crear un Pedido Avanzado con Detalles (Transaccional)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders-advanced
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "1",
  "products": [
    {
      "product_id": "1",
      "quantity": 3,
      "unit_price": 22.50
    }
  ]
}

###

### 6. Registrar Movimiento de Inventario Avanzado
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory-movements-advanced
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": "1",
  "warehouse_id": "1",
  "movement_type": "entry",
  "quantity": 50
}
